  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>Flovat is a fast-growing beauty brand offering high-demand natural skincare products, including cosmetic oils, essential oils, handmade soaps, and body scrubs. Our products are designed for visible results—hydrated, glowing, and smooth skin—while tapping into the booming clean beauty trend.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>Flovat combines trendy, aesthetic products with real performance. Our products are highly “content-friendly” (perfect for TikTok &amp; Reels), making it easier for creators to go viral and drive sales. We focus on simple, effective skincare that people love to share.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Earn competitive commissions on every sale using your personal link or discount code. The more you promote, the more you earn—no limits. High-performing affiliates can unlock higher commissions and exclusive deals.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Create short-form content (TikTok, Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts) showing product texture, results, routines, and transformations. Use hooks like “this made my skin glow” or “my new skincare obsession” and include your discount code to boost conversions.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We actively support our affiliates with content ideas, fast communication, and growth opportunities. Selected creators receive free products for testing. If you’re looking for a brand that converts and scales with you—Flovat is the right choice.</p></div></div>",
